1764 0 obj
  << /ActualText (NeuraLyfe\nFigBuild 2026 \024 1st Place out of 690\nDesigned a sideline decision\055support system that translates helmet impact data into actionable neurological risk insights for medical staff\056\n\042 Designed three views to scan team risk\054 investigate brain status\054 and replay the flagged impact\n\042 Prototyped real\055time risk monitoring and impact analysis in Figma Make\n\042 Translated neurological data into clear sideline decision signals)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1765 0 R
     /Pg 1748 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
